  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging Technical Assistance to School Education Departments in Punjab and Khyber Pakhtunkhwa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Short-term (Bridging) Technical Assistance to the Education Departments of the Governments of Punjab and Khyber Pakhtunkhwa&#x201d; in order to support ongoing reforms initiated through FCDO&#x2019;s previous education sector programmes (PESP and KESP) and bridge the gap till the Long-Term TA is commercially procured and teams are in place.</narrative>
  </description>
